# api-extractor generates these — prettier would reformat and break api:check
*.api.md

# A plan is the live source of truth for a slice that may still be executing,
# so a task's `format:write` step must never rewrite it — an executor
# reformatting the document it is executing races every other slice reading it.
# Prettier is also non-idempotent on these: it oscillates the indentation of
# fenced code nested inside `- [ ]` steps, so --write can never satisfy --check.
# Verified by three consecutive --write passes producing three different files.
docs/superpowers/plans/
